          "settings": {
            "layout": "left",
            "title": "GIA Lab Certificate",
            "tcl": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>By establishing and upholding the standards used to gauge gemstone quality, the Gemological Institute of America safeguards both buyers and sellers of all gemstones. We are proud to be associated with the GIA (Gemological Institute of America), one of the best laboratories for examining and grading gemstones and jewellery.</p><p>GIA operates independently of business and private affairs, governmental lobbies, and advocacy organisations as a non-profit organisation.</p><p>To ensure unbiased evaluation, all gemstones are analysed in complete customer confidentiality. As a result, buyers and sellers of gemstones all over the world regard <a href=\"https://brahmagems.com/gia-certified-gemstones.html\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>GIA-certified gemstones</strong></a> as the most authentic.</p>",
            "cl": "#000000",
            "button_label": "",
