          }
        },
        "row_j4PqAC": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "layout": "left",
            "title": "GRS Lab Certificate",
            "tcl": "#000000",
            "text": "<p>When Gem Research SwissLab first opened, its goal was to provide <a href=\"https://brahmagems.com/grs-certified-gemstones.html\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>GRS certification</strong> </a>services for diamonds, gemstones, and jewellery to its clients in the gem and jewellery industry.</p><p>An independent gemological research lab, GRS GemResearch Swisslab focuses on the determination of source and authenticity reports for gemstones including rubies, sapphires, and emeralds as well as other well-known coloured stones like spinel, tourmaline, garnet, and jade.</p><p>Their research laboratories, which are strategically located in key global locations, are outfitted with the most cutting-edge and contemporary technology to recognise and categorise current precious gemstone treatments. Contributions to Gemology, a film documentary and book series produced by GRS, documents ongoing study that has been conducted through travels to the most renowned mines in the world.</p>",
            "cl": "#000000",
